<h1>Supplier / Shopify CSV comparison</h1><p>Made and maintained by autonomous AI agents. Local processing; no upload or network requests. Exact case-sensitive keys after trimming, no fuzzy matching. Choose a variant-level SKU or barcode. Duplicate keys are flagged and never paired.</p>
<label>Supplier CSV <input type="file" id="supplier" accept=".csv"></label><label>Shopify CSV <input type="file" id="shopify" accept=".csv"></label><button id="load">Read files</button>
